:''For the enemy, see [[Malevolent Flying Cat]].''
'''Brainwashed Bird Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Easter Carnival (Gacha Event)|Easter Carnival]], [[Valentine Gals (Gacha Event)|Valentine Gals]], [[Gals of Summer Sunshine (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Sunshine]] and [[Excellent 4 Selection (Gacha Event)|Excellent 4 Selection]] events. It was added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.7 Update|Version 12.7]] grants a 100% chance to [[Slow]] [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemies for 2 seconds.

